  "summary": "Malicious code in bigops-call-history (npm)",
  "details": "On require(), the package runs _init.js which fingerprints the operating system and CPU architecture, then downloads a platform-specific binary payload from Cloudflare Workers CDN endpoints (b-worker[.]cf100-416[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf99-9b3[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf103-070[.]workers[.]dev) with a DNS-based fallback via wel1[.]ru. The downloaded binary is written to /var/tmp/.cache_\u003crandom\u003e (Linux/macOS) or %TEMP%\\dotnet_diag_\u003crandom\u003e.exe (Windows) and executed as a detached background process. A marker file at /tmp/.analytics_state or %TEMP%\\analytics_state prevents re-downloading within approximately 6 hours. The package respects DISABLE_TELEMETRY, ANALYTICS_OPT_OUT, and DO_NOT_TRACK environment variables as an evasion mechanism.",
